{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1087076-a-world-of-corporate-darkness-big-image-warning","id":1087076,"title":"A World of Corporate Darkness (big image warning)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-03T03:05:48-07:00","id":1087076,"title":"A World of Corporate Darkness (big image warning)","content":"Time for the latest in Crazy Uncle Loomer's Charts and Graphs. This one gets its own thread, though, since it's a doozy. Ever wonder where the money goes when your characters buy something? Ever need a new company to throw at your players when they can remember all the <i>mainstream</i> Pentex subsidiaries and affiliates off by heart? Ever need a totally mundane, non-evil corporation for your backstory? Well, now you can get them all in one convenient chart. Remember kids, capitalism is the real monster and you can't kill it with fire unless it's the fire of COMMUNIST REVOLUTION.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/DY8Yjme.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> You may need to click <a href=\"http://i.imgur.com/DY8Yjme.png\" target=\"_blank\">http://i.imgur.com/DY8Yjme.png</a> for big.<br /> I may be missing a few or have misfiled them, and they're not all super legible, but I reckon that's the most comprehensive option out there yet. Anywhere that's mostly a 1-store business got omitted, with a few exceptions, which is why Siegfried's nightclubs aren't on there. As for Grimm's magic shop, well, I couldn't be bothered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T03:40:39-07:00","id":1087081,"title":"","content":"Yay, Loomer time!<br /> <br /> I find it interesting that, of all the Technocracy Conventions, it's Iteration X that seems to have no holdings or corporate ties. I'd have suspected it'd be the Void Engineers that leave that to their fellow conventions. Huh.<br /> <br /> Question:<br /> \u200bI noticed that 'Imbued Control' is near the vampire companies, but isn't printed in bold lettering - an oversight? It's easy to miss in the pile.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-03T04:07:01-07:00","id":1087091,"title":"","content":"On another note..you have sooo much white, empty space in tha